QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Join  (cost=6.50..37.75 rows=300 width=22)
  Hash Cond: ((hjc_5.b + 1) = (hjc_4.a + 1))
  ->  Seq Scan on hjc_5  (cost=0.00..5.00 rows=300 width=11)
  ->  Hash  (cost=4.00..4.00 rows=200 width=11)
        ->  Seq Scan on hjc_4  (cost=0.00..4.00 rows=200 width=11)
-- EXPLAIN

> explain select * from hjc_4 join hjc_5 on length(t) = b
QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Join  (cost=8.75..20.25 rows=300 width=22)
  Hash Cond: (length(hjc_4.t) = hjc_5.b)
  ->  Seq Scan on hjc_4  (cost=0.00..4.00 rows=200 width=11)
  ->  Hash  (cost=5.00..5.00 rows=300 width=11)
        ->  Seq Scan on hjc_5  (cost=0.00..5.00 rows=300 width=11)
-- EXPLAIN

> explain select * from hjc_4 join hjc_5 on a::text = u
QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Join  (cost=8.75..23.75 rows=300 width=22)
  Hash Cond: ((hjc_4.a)::text = hjc_5.u)
  ->  Seq Scan on hjc_4  (cost=0.00..4.00 rows=200 width=11)
  ->  Hash  (cost=5.00..5.00 rows=300 width=11)
        ->  Seq Scan on hjc_5  (cost=0.00..5.00 rows=300 width=11)
-- EXPLAIN

> explain select * from hjc_4 join hjc_5 on (a % 10) = (b % 10)
QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Join  (cost=6.50..37.75 rows=300 width=22)
  Hash Cond: ((hjc_5.b % 10) = (hjc_4.a % 10))
